{"id":"624204","name":"苦菜拌羊肉","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/624204/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"羊肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"苦菜","amount":"一把"}],"sub":[{"name":"纯净水","amount":"若干"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"羊肉骨冷水下锅焯水。","img":"images/624204/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"煮开3分钟即可。","img":"images/624204/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洗净浮沫。","img":"images/624204/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放砂锅里，放纯净水和食盐。","img":"images/624204/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切葱姜。","img":"images/624204/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放葱姜，大火烧开10分钟。","img":"images/624204/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"小火炖70分钟即可。","img":"images/624204/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"取羊肉。","img":"images/624204/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"撕成块。","img":"images/624204/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"野菜摘干净。","img":"images/624204/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"洗净。","img":"images/624204/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"葱芽切段。","img":"images/624204/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"所有食材放一起。","img":"images/624204/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放食盐。","img":"images/624204/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放白醋。","img":"images/624204/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/624204/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/624204/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}